I am in Mumbai.
Today I am in an old café.
This is an Irani café.
I go inside the café.
The café is very crowded.
People are drinking tea.
Some people are talking loudly.
I look around.
The atmosphere here is very vintage.
There are dark wooden chairs here.
There are checkered tablecloths on the tables.
The ceiling of the café is very high.
I look up.
There are large fans on the ceiling.
These fans are turning very slowly.
I like this place very much.
I want a place to sit.
I step forward inside.
